  "sentences": {
    "docs/design.md": [
      "the question deadline starts when ask is admitted and covers forwarding as well as waiting for an answer.",
      "a parent that does not acknowledge delivery before that deadline produces a timed-out tool failure carrying the default in its message.",
      "without an acknowledged message identifier, the runtime records no synthetic reply.",
      "acknowledgement uses the remaining question time for the default answer.",
      "a log containing a successful ask without a recorded response is refused because its process-owned deadline cannot be restored.",
      "an explicit --from dir@seq starts a separate episode from the selected conversation prefix; questions in that prefix are historical."
    ],
    "docs/log-format.md": [
      "a question and its answer have different sources, including when an episode addresses itself."
    ],
    "docs/protocol.md": [
      "a host tool wait releases its pending answer registration when it finishes, including when its future is cancelled.",
      "an ask deadline includes the wait for its parent to acknowledge delivery.",
      "an unacknowledged question returns timed-out; an acknowledged question uses the remaining time for its default answer."
    ],
    "docs/tools.md": [
      "an ask deadline includes forwarding and waiting for delivery acknowledgement.",
      "an unacknowledged call returns timed-out with the default in its error text.",
      "an acknowledged question uses the remaining time before delivering its default as a synthetic response."
    ]
  }
